  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Speech-to-Code is a web application that uses LLMs to convert spoken language into executable code, letting developers express ideas verbally and get functional code. The project structure includes a backend (main.py, llm_interaction.py, model_config.py, system_prompts.json, context_maps, utils) and a frontend with components, services, and config directories, plus a logs/chat_sessions directory.",
